# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1327
msgid ""
"OpenTopography: enables 30 m DEM resolution (vs default 90 m), plus 10 m USGS DEM in the US.\n"
"This SAME key also gates the 1 m USGS lidar option in Terrain options -> Advanced terrain size, but OpenTopography restricts that specific dataset to academic-verified accounts -- an ordinary free key here gets 10 m instead (Terrain options shows which one actually loaded).\n"
"Free key at portal.opentopography.org"
msgstr ""
"OpenTopography: 启用 30 m DEM 分辨率（vs 默认 90 m），并在美国提供 10 m USGS DEM。\n"
"此相同密钥还控制地形选项 -> 高级地形尺寸中的 1 m USGS lidar 选项，但 OpenTopography 将该特定数据集限制于经过学术验证的账户——此处普通免费密钥只能获得 10 m（地形选项会显示实际加载的是哪个）。\n"
"免费密钥在 portal.opentopography.org"

