msgstr "连接器损耗（电线/管道损耗 + 烧毁）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1513
msgid ""
"Simulates I²R voltage-drop losses in wires/cords and friction losses in hoses/pipes based on their routed 3D length. Sustained overload can burn out a connector."
msgstr "根据电线/电缆和软管/管道的布设 3D 长度，模拟 I²R 电压降损耗和摩擦损耗。持续过载可能会烧毁连接器。"

