#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1800
msgid "Used when \"matches the haze\" is off."
msgstr "当“匹配雾气”关闭时使用。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1801
msgid "Horizon height °"
msgstr "地平线高度 °"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1802
msgid "Horizon softness °"
msgstr "地平线柔和度 °"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1803
msgid "Horizon haze band"
msgstr "地平线雾带"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 4 Fog layer height °
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1804
msgid "Haze band height °"
msgstr "雾带高度 °"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1805
msgid "Sky overhead"
msgstr "天顶天空"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1806
msgid "Sky near horizon"
msgstr "地平线附近天空"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1807
msgid ""
"Height moves the sky's horizon line up or down (degrees above level) — useful from a drone, where the terrain's edge sits below level. Softness is how far below the line the sky takes to reach the horizon colour. The haze band is a glow of that colour fading up into the sky; it is what blends hazy distant ground into the sky on flat land. The two sky colours are the clear daytime gradient (twilight and night paint over them)."
msgstr ""
"高度值可上下移动天空的地平线（高于水平线的度数）— 对无人机视角特别有用，因为地形边缘可能会低于水平线。柔和度决定了天空需要下降多远才能达到地平线颜色。薄雾带是这种颜色的光晕，向上淡入天空；它用于平坦地带将朦胧的远地地面与天空融合。两个天空颜色分别是晴朗白天的渐变（黄昏和夜晚会覆盖它们）。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1810
msgid "Atmospheric haze"
msgstr "大气霾"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 5 Fog amount
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1811
msgid "Fog amount"
msgstr "雾量"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1812
msgid "Haze density ×"
msgstr "霾密度 ×"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1813
msgid "Haze takes sky colour ×"
msgstr "霾采天空色 ×"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1814
msgid "Haze glow toward sun ×"
msgstr "霾向太阳发光 ×"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1815
msgid "Daytime haze colour"
msgstr "白天霾色"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1816
msgid "Dusk haze coolness"
msgstr "黄昏霾冷度"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 3 Dissipates at sunset
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1817
msgid "Late-day clearing"
msgstr "日落时分消散"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1818
msgid ""
"The haze is the distance fog that fades far ground toward the sky. Density × scales how quickly it thickens with distance (lower = clearer desert air); Fog amount adds more on top and also sets the thickness of volumetric fog (Lighting). \"Takes sky colour\" is how much distant ground picks up the sky's own colour instead of the haze colour. Dusk coolness pushes twilight haze from warm amber (0) to blue-grey (1). Late-day clearing thins the haze in the hours before sunset so distant ridges stay dark."
msgstr ""
"霾是远距离的雾，它将远处的地面淡化到天空。密度 × 决定了它随距离变浓的快慢（越低 = 越清晰的沙漠空气）；雾量在上面增加更多，也设置了体积雾的厚度（灯光）。“采天空色”决定了远地地面吸收天空自身颜色的多少，而不是霾的颜色。黄昏冷度将黄昏霾从暖琥珀色（0）推向蓝灰色（1）。日落时分消散在日落前几个小时稀释霾，使远处的山脊保持黑暗。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1820
msgid "Reset horizon & haze"
msgstr "重置地平线和霾"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1821
msgid "Put every control in Horizon and Atmospheric haze back to its default."
msgstr "将地平线和大气霾中的所有控制项恢复到默认值。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1829
msgid "Sun energy"
msgstr "太阳能"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1830
msgid "Sun disc size"
msgstr "太阳盘大小"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1831
msgid "Sun glow"
msgstr "太阳光晕"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1832
msgid "Sun glow size"
msgstr "太阳光晕大小"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1833
msgid "Sun aureole"
msgstr "太阳光环"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1834
msgid "Low-sun warmth"
msgstr "低日照暖度"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 4 Sunlight follows real atmosphere: None until the disc crosses the horizon, then a percentage of deep orange, halved at 10°, and white at 30°. Low light warmth is the degree to which direct light near the horizon turns red (0 = white).
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1835
msgid ""
"Sunlight follows the real atmosphere: none until the disc clears the horizon, then a few percent of noon in deep orange, half strength by 10°, white by 30°. Low-sun warmth is the reddening of the direct light near the horizon (0 = white)."
msgstr ""
"阳光遵循真实大气：直到光盘越过地平线之前没有，然后是深橙色的百分比，到 10° 时减半，到 30° 时变为白色。低日照暖度是地平线附近直射光变红的程度（0 = 白色）。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1838
msgid "Twilight"
msgstr "黄昏"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1839
msgid "Twilight drama"
msgstr "黄昏戏剧性"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1840
msgid "Twilight length"
msgstr "黄昏时长"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 3 Adjust the dramatic horizon band, sun halo, and glow near the horizon, as well as the pink Venus band opposite the sun (1.0 = natural, 0 = flat). Duration determines the speed of fading of the sky and ground after sunset (1 = natural, for screen compression).
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1841
msgid ""
"Drama scales the horizon fire band, the sun's aureole and glow near the horizon, and the pink Belt of Venus opposite the sun (1.0 = natural, 0 = flat). Length stretches how slowly the sky and ground fade after sunset (1 = natural, compressed for the screen)."
msgstr ""
"戏剧性调节地平线火带、太阳光环和地平线附近的辉光，以及与太阳对立的粉色金星带（1.0 = 自然，0 = 平坦）。时长决定了日落后天空和地面淡化的速度（1 = 自然，为屏幕压缩）。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1844
msgid "Moon"
msgstr "月亮"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1845
msgid "Moon energy"
msgstr "月亮能"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1847
msgid "Moon disc size"
msgstr "月盘大小"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 4 Moonlight glow
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1848
msgid "Moon glow"
msgstr "月光辉"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1849
msgid "Moonlit sky"
msgstr "月夜天空"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1852
msgid "Night sky"
msgstr "夜空"

# qa: 4 fixed by hand after a low score
# machine: hand fix 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1853
msgid "Airglow"
msgstr "气辉"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1854
msgid "Airglow colour"
msgstr "空光颜色"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 5 Light pollution
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1855
msgid "Light pollution"
msgstr "光污染"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1856
msgid "Pollution colour"
msgstr "污染颜色"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1857
msgid ""
"The dark sky is a near-black gradient plus three light sources: airglow (the faint green band real dark skies show low down), a light-pollution dome, and moonlight (Moon → Moonlit sky). All zero on a moonless night = a Bortle-1 wilderness sky. Bright skies wash out faint stars (Stars & Planets → Sky-glow washout)."
msgstr ""
"深空接近纯黑渐变，加上三个光源：空光（深空低处的微弱绿带）、光污染穹顶和月光（月亮 → 月夜天空）。无月夜所有为零 = 博特尔1级荒野天空。明亮的天空会冲淡微弱的星光（恒星与行星 → 天空光冲淡）。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1905
msgid "Graphics Quality (performance)"
msgstr "图形质量（性能）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1907
msgid "Low (fastest)"
msgstr "低（最快）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1908
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "中"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1909
msgid "High (default)"
msgstr "高（默认）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1910
msgid "Ultra (strong GPUs)"
msgstr "超（强力GPU）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1915
msgid ""
"Presets scale shadow-map size, soft-shadow filtering, TAA, and the vegetation tier (detail-ring size, leaf density, tree budgets). Ultra adds tree shadows and bigger detail rings."
msgstr "预设缩放阴影贴图大小、柔和阴影过滤、TAA和植被层级（细节环大小、叶子密度、树木预算）。超级模式增加树木阴影和更大的细节环。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1924
msgid "Terrain detail (imagery resolution)"
msgstr "地形细节（影像分辨率）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1928
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "质量"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1949
msgid ""
"Sharpens close-up (walking) terrain by fetching higher-zoom aerial tiles over a wider area. Higher tiers use more VRAM and a longer first download (then cached); only applies to generated location maps. Sculpting speed is unaffected."
msgstr ""
"通过获取更广区域更高缩放级别的航空瓦片来锐化近距离（步行）地形。更高层级会占用更多VRAM和更长的首次下载时间（之后会缓存）；仅适用于生成的地点地图。雕塑速度不受影响。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1959
msgid "Sharpest layer"
msgstr "最清晰层"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1964
msgid "Sharpest photo (may be older)"
msgstr "最清晰照片（可能较旧）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1965
msgid "Newest photo (matches the map)"
msgstr "最新照片（与地图匹配）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1967
msgid ""
"This world only. The close-up imagery round your site can come from a sharper photo that is sometimes years older than the rest of the map, so things that change (a shoreline, new buildings) can jump at its edge. Newest uses the same photo as the map round it: one date everywhere, a little softer up close."
msgstr ""
"仅此世界。您站点附近的近景影像可能来自比地图其余部分老了多年的更清晰照片，因此变化的事物（海岸线、新建筑）可能会在边缘跳跃。最新照片使用与周围地图相同的照片：所有地方日期一致，近处略柔和。"

