# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:2962
msgid ""
"Small props fade out past the draw distance to save GPU; large landmarks (StarShade, domes, racks) stay visible. Turning off prop shadows helps on sites with thousands of props. F3 opens the live frame-cost overlay."
msgstr ""
"小道具在超出绘制距离后会淡出以节省 GPU；大型地标（StarShade、穹顶、货架）保持可见。关闭道具阴影有助于处理拥有数千个道具的场地。F3 打开实时帧成本覆盖层。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3153
msgid ""
"Frame time is over 22 ms and MSAA is above this graphics preset. 8× was about 12 ms on a dense forest. Preset's is the cheaper setting."
msgstr "帧时间超过 22 ms，且 MSAA 高于此图形预设。在茂密森林中 8× 大约是 12 ms。预设是更经济的设置。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3590
msgid "Key bindings"
msgstr "按键绑定"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3591
msgid ""
"Click a key to change it, then press the new key (or a mouse side button; Esc cancels). Keys are remembered by position, so they stay put on any keyboard layout. ↺ puts a key back to the default. The F1 help, the on-screen prompts and the tour show whatever you choose."
msgstr ""
"点击一个键进行更改，然后按下新键（或鼠标侧键；Esc 取消）。按键按位置记忆，因此在任何键盘布局上都会保持原位。↺ 将按键恢复到默认。F1 帮助、屏幕提示和导览将显示您选择的内容。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
