# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3789
msgid ""
"F5 switches between them in play. Third person is a follow camera: the mouse orbits it, you walk the way it faces and your body turns to follow; on a vehicle it chases behind."
msgstr "F5 在游戏中在两者间切换。第三人称是跟随摄像机：鼠标围绕它旋转，您朝它面向方向行走，身体会跟随转动；在载具上则在后方追随。"

