#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3791
msgid ""
"Horizontal field of view on foot, in both views. Wider = more peripheral view (and more lens distortion). Drone FOV is under the Drone tab."
msgstr "步行时的水平视场角，两种视图均适用。越广 = 周边视野越广（且透视畸变更明显）。无人机 FOV 在“无人机”选项卡下。"

