msgid "Body"
msgstr "身体"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3815
msgid "Rescan"
msgstr "重新扫描"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3816
msgid "Look for new character files"
msgstr "查找新的角色文件"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3836
msgid "Outline colour"
msgstr "轮廓颜色"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3839
msgid "Open characters folder…"
msgstr "打开角色文件夹…"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3844
msgid ""
"The default body is a detailed version of the NPCs' stick figure. To play as another character, drop a .glb, .gltf or .fbx into the characters folder and press Rescan. Its own clips are used when they are named idle / walk / run; a Mixamo-rigged character without them borrows Remy's idle, walk and jog (needs the Player Character pack). Remy appears in the list when that pack is installed."
msgstr ""
"默认模型是 NPC 的精细版骨架。如需使用其他角色，请将 .glb、.gltf 或 .fbx 文件拖放到角色文件夹中并按下重新扫描。其自带的动作片段用于命名为 idle / walk / run 的动作；没有这些片段的 Mixamo 骨架角色将借用 Remy 的 idle、walk 和 jog（需要玩家角色包）。当安装了该包后，Remy 会出现在列表中。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3853
msgid "Crowd detail (look vs performance)"
msgstr "人群细节（外观 vs 性能）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3854
msgid "Full-detail figures"
msgstr "全细节人物"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3858
msgid "Simulated in full"
msgstr "完全模拟"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 3 Crowd Character Coverage
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3862
msgid "Crowd figure reach"
msgstr "人群人物覆盖范围"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3866
msgid ""
"Lighter at high speed (fewer full figures and full simulation above 300×)"
msgstr "高速下更轻（300× 以上减少全人物和完全模拟）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3869
msgid ""
"At 300× and faster a full figure is a blur: shrink both budgets (to about 60 % at 300×, 30 % at 1000×) to keep the frame rate up."
msgstr "在 300× 及以上倍率下，全人物会模糊：请缩小两个预算（在 300× 时约为 60%，在 1000× 时约为 30%）以保持帧率。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3885
msgid "Now: no people simulated on this map."
msgstr "当前：此地图上未模拟人群。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3896
msgid ""
"Turn a number up and watch the frame rate here (or F3). The full simulation and the full figures cost CPU; the crowd figures and their reach cost GPU. 0 / far left = Auto."
msgstr "调高一个数值，观察此处的帧率（或按 F3）。完全模拟和全人物消耗 CPU；人群人物及其覆盖范围消耗 GPU。0 / 最左侧 = 自动。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3947
msgid "Population"
msgstr "人口"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3948
msgid "Simulate & draw NPCs"
msgstr "模拟与绘制 NPC"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3951
msgid ""
"Off: every person is frozen and hidden, with no simulation or rendering cost. Habitats bill their authored headcount at the classic constant rate, so the graph's water/food/waste numbers still mean something. Switch back on and the community resumes where it was left (a long gap is caught up the usual way). Festival mode switches it back on."
msgstr ""
"关闭：每人都处于冻结和隐藏状态，无模拟或渲染成本。栖息地按其设定的固定速率计费人口数，因此图表中的水/食物/废物数据仍然有意义。重新开启后，社区将从上次中断的地方恢复（长时间间隔会按常规方式补齐）。节日模式会重新开启它。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3952
msgid ""
"Turn off for site analysis — no NPC logic, figures, crowd, chips or alarms. The people are paused, not deleted."
msgstr "关闭以进行现场分析——无 NPC 逻辑、人物、人群、芯片或警报。人员处于暂停状态，而非删除。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3956
msgid "Animation editor…"
msgstr "动画编辑器…"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3957
msgid ""
"Pose and keyframe the stick figure with a tool in its hands — sawing, drilling, fastening, carrying — and save the clips the build crews play."
msgstr "使用工具为骨架人物摆姿势和设置关键帧——锯木、钻孔、固定、携带——并保存建筑工人的动作片段。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3964
msgid "Body style"
msgstr "身体风格"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3973
msgid "Humanoid (rigged)"
msgstr "类人（骨架）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3974
msgid "Simplified (stylised)"
msgstr "简化（风格化）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3982
msgid ""
"Simplified draws articulated stick figures with elbows and knees. Behaviour is identical — only the look changes. Takes effect as people come back into view."
msgstr "简化版绘制带有肘部和膝盖的关节骨架。行为相同——仅外观改变。当人员重新进入视野时生效。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3993
msgid "Mo-cap spice"
msgstr "动作捕捉增强"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4003
msgid ""
"Simplified style: how often a nearby stick figure breaks into a real motion-captured clip (FUCK YES, a cheer, a dance break, a story, a stretch…) before easing back. 0 = never (procedural only), middle = as designed, right = twice as often. Clips live in Imported Models/NPC/mocap/<moment>/ (see docs/ASSETS.md); a moment with none stays procedural."
msgstr ""
"简化风格：附近骨架人物偶尔会爆发成真实的动作捕捉片段（太棒了，欢呼、跳舞、故事、伸展……）后再平稳恢复。0 = 从不（仅程序化），中间 = 按设计，右 = 频率翻倍。片段存储在 Imported Models/NPC/mocap/<moment>/（参见 docs/ASSETS.md）；没有片段的时刻保持程序化。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4016
msgid ""
"The humanoid character pack is not installed (see docs/ASSETS.md) — simplified is in use regardless."
msgstr "未安装类人角色包（参见 docs/ASSETS.md）——无论如何都使用简化版。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4023
msgid "Dance to the beat"
msgstr "随着节拍起舞"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 3 People dancing near the performance stage move with the beat, raising their hands when the bass builds and jumping when the bass drops; the DJ raises one arm during the warm-up phase. The stage's own track (its music) is analyzed in real-time; performances without a track will generate a virtual track with a typical beat. LED lights in the lighting studio (J) have their own "sound response" switch.
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4026
msgid ""
"People dancing near a playing stage move on its beat, put their hands up as a drop builds and jump when it lands; the DJ holds an arm up through the run-up. A stage's own track (its Music) is analysed live; a set with no track gets a made-up one at a typical tempo. LED lights have their own \"Sound reactive\" switch in the Light Studio (J)."
msgstr ""
"在表演舞台附近跳舞的人会随着节拍移动，在低音构建时举起双手并在低音落下时跳跃；DJ 在预热阶段会举起一只手臂。舞台自身的曲目（其音乐）会实时分析；没有曲目的演出会生成一个典型节拍的虚拟曲目。LED 灯在灯光工作室（J）有自己的“声音响应”开关。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4033
msgid "Alex, Sam, River, …"
msgstr "亚历克斯、山姆、里弗，…"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4039
msgid "Add to the name list"
msgstr "添加到姓名列表"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4048
msgid "using the built-in names"
msgstr "使用内置名称"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4048
msgid "{n} of your names in the list"
msgid_plural "{n} of your names in the list"
msgstr[0] "列表中的 {n} 个名字"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4066
msgid "Show NPC tint colors"
msgstr "显示 NPC 色彩"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4070
msgid ""
"Each person gets a distinct pastel outline by default. Turn off to render everyone in plain black — no individual colors."
msgstr "默认情况下，每个人都有独特的柔和轮廓。关闭后，所有人渲染为纯黑色——无个体颜色。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4080
msgid "Overhead status"
msgstr "过顶状态"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4085
msgid "Always (nearby)"
msgstr "始终（附近）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4086
msgid "Only when aimed at"
msgstr "仅瞄准时"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4096
msgid ""
"The task tag (and, if enabled below, the morale bar) above each head. 'Always' shows them for people within ~30 m; 'Off' keeps clean silhouettes (aiming still names people)."
msgstr "每个头部上方的任务标签（以及下方是否启用的情绪条）。“始终”显示距离约 30 m 内的人；“关闭”保持干净的轮廓（瞄准时仍显示姓名）。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4102
msgid "Show mood bars over heads"
msgstr "显示头部情绪条"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4105
msgid "Peak Experience toasts (FUCK YES!!!)"
msgstr "巅峰体验提示（太棒了！！！）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4108
msgid "Beacon over each FUCK YES!!! (where it happened)"
msgstr "每个太棒了！！！（发生地点）上的信标"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4111
msgid "Fun Meter (the crowd's overall vibe, a needle gauge)"
msgstr "乐趣值（人群的整体氛围，一个指针表）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4119
msgid "FUCK YES contagion"
msgstr "太棒了！！！传染"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4129
msgid ""
"How strongly one person at FUCK YES!!! raises the odds of the people round them. 0 = no spread (every peak is its own spark), 1 = as designed, 4 = wildfire."
msgstr "一个人在太棒了！！！时能提高周围人群几率的强度。0 = 无传播（每次高峰都是独立的火花），1 = 按设计，4 = 野火。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4145
msgid "Stage music volume"
msgstr "舞台音乐音量"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4155
msgid ""
"Volume of the tracks venues play during their sets (set a venue's track in its Ctrl-focus row → Music). 0 = off."
msgstr "每个场地在演出期间播放的曲目音量（在场地的 Ctrl-焦点行 → 音乐中设置场地的曲目）。0 = 关闭。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4164
msgid "Ambient sound volume"
msgstr "环境音量"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4174
msgid ""
"The first-person sound bed: wind with the weather's wind speed, rain with the rain rate, the nearest stream's rush, birdsong by daylight in the forest. Silent while the clock is paused and away from first person. Drop your own wind / rain / stream / birds .mp3, .ogg or .wav into user://ambient/ to replace the built-in sounds. 0 = off."
msgstr ""
"第一人称音景：风与天气风速、雨与降雨量、最近溪流的潺潺声、森林中的鸟鸣。当时钟暂停且远离第一人称时保持静音。将您自己的 wind / rain / stream / birds .mp3、.ogg 或 .wav 放入 user://ambient/ 以替换内置声音。0 = 关闭。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4179
msgid ""
"People glow with how good a time they are having; a crowd that is vibing with its needs met builds a CHARGE toward FUCK YES!!! — a green shimmer that grows and quickens on the body, faster with peakers nearby (the meter over their head shows it, with ↑ while someone is feeding it) — then tips into a green, pulsing glow and the samba. Every one scores a Peak Experience. Each person's state (FUCK THIS!!! … Fuck It!) shows over their head; the bars are off by default."
msgstr ""
"人们会根据过得好不好而发光；一个需求得到满足、充满活力的群体会朝着太棒了！！！积聚“能量”——一种在身体上生长的、加速的绿色微光，附近有高峰时更快（头上的仪表会显示，有人为其供能时有 ↑）——然后转变为绿色脉冲光芒和桑巴舞。每个人都会获得一次巅峰体验。每个人的状态（太糟了！！！……可算！）会显示在他们头上；默认情况下，这些条是关闭的。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4190
msgid "Draw people"
msgstr "绘制人物"

